        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Charles Eames, Ray Eames, László Moholy-Nagy, Hans Wegner\n- Topics: Good Design, Organic Functionality, modernism, furniture design\n- Places: Denmark\n\nFacts:\n- Hans Jørgensen Wegner was born on April 2, 1914, and died on January 26, 2007.\n- Hans Jørgensen Wegner was a world-renowned Danish furniture designer.\n- Hans Wegner is associated with the Good Design movement alongside Charles Eames, Ray Eames, and László Moholy-Nagy.\n- Hans Wegner's style is often described as Organic Functionality, a modernist school that emphasizes functionality.",
